{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "4aa2b1f79fce4385f34251b3dbb16e3ddbdc368dcdabbabe87e069111da5c4de", "ja": "新しい風", "zh": "崭新的风潮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "11b4b85a9025ac30213c44795ba595fae170cbc2bb35557108f98139beee65d4", "ja": "アイドルサマーフェスティバルの数日後、\n劇場に詩花が訪れる。プロデューサーは\n詩花がもたらした劇場の新しい未来を楽しみ\nにしつつ、詩花のためにも良かったと思うの\nだった。", "zh": "偶像夏日祭结束几天过后，\n诗花前来剧场拜访。\n制作人期待诗花为剧场\n带来的崭新未来，\n并认为这对诗花应该也很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eea6d247f3c5973d2169fe901db62f87994ae3b8e7c896d6b34af3da29af3d03", "ja": "（真夏の日々を熱く燃え上がらせたアイサマから、\n数日が過ぎた……今日は、劇場で打ち上げだ）", "zh": "（使盛夏时光燃烧得更为火热的偶夏，\n已经结束好几天了……今天大家在剧场举办庆功宴。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "d3143273db9e13e7a34f075e6bd28a505ab67d69a3ad764a5db08318e72776ce", "ja": "ひなた、可憐！\n美咲からもらったスイカ、切っといたぜ！", "zh": "日向、可怜！\n美咲送的西瓜已经切好啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "ef094939dea57cc601498cfcee01c7311c60486e615990c6c6fdaba41e0eaed2", "ja": "昴さん、ありがとねぇ！\nしたっけ、あたしもお漬物を切ってくるべさ。", "zh": "昴，谢谢你呢～！\n那我也来切腌渍物哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "7c7c7a114b2988fce90f45725396613c61003455dad97b7428b165a59b01e910", "ja": "わ、私は、ディフューザーの準備を……。\n今日は……ローズ精油がいいかな……♪", "zh": "我、我来准备喷雾机……\n今天应该适合……玫瑰精油……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "dfd7deedeb3dd39b9a23f6268dcb709458dfb2cc0069bc37f4b427fe67472ae8", "ja": "にゃはは♪　みんな、お待たせ！\n連れてきたよ～！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪大家久等啦！\n我带她来啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1008_201xxx", "source_sha256": "04e5057d2e09573b3bc31221512056e6505e608cd9dc30b92dc9b4dcc0c772c1", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪\n本日はお招きいただき、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "Grüß Gott♪\n谢谢大家今天邀请我过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cbde0037b8ddcf3f8150db97121a53527b1a54689a70753462564fd7480757b7", "ja": "こちらこそ、わざわざ来てくれてありがとう。\n迷惑じゃなかったかな？", "zh": "彼此彼此，谢谢你专程来参加。\n会不会给你添麻烦啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "cc6e8993d91f3e61880200c8cebb35422d38bb77b931e7632a1044fedb97db8e", "ja": "もちろんです♪　こんな風に、プライベートでお邪魔\nさせてもらえるなんて、とっても楽しみです♪", "zh": "当然不会♪\n能像这样私下前来拜访大家，我觉得很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "2c12c84421c0565e5282579fd4c019b789166dca293523e3b2a5ee160030bf31", "ja": "にゃはは♪　楽しいってことなら、\nうちの劇場はどこにも負けないよね！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪\n论开心的程度，我们剧场也不会输喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "48de26211d0352498556d8655b350a9c50d100298be77f1dc8b91c13cb497dde", "ja": "もうすぐ他のみんなも来るはずだからねぇ。\nそしたら、詩花さんを紹介せねばなぁ♪", "zh": "其他人应该很快就会来了呢，\n到时候得介绍给诗花认识哪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "9d762825fed9b4e88bb0f5cf9babf9430c68ea53578c22d4d0be919b97f3e2a6", "ja": "でもみんなが集まったら、さすがに狭いんだよな～。\nみんな詩花の周りに集まるだろうし。", "zh": "不过大家到齐之后，就会变很挤耶～\n因为大家一定会聚在诗花旁边啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "5d8ef59835455739599b4c755e5c7d9312158db615cff32c8d92731170e23754", "ja": "そうだ！　いっそのこと野球しようぜ！\nここ公園も近いんだよ、詩花！", "zh": "对了！干脆来打棒球吧！\n这里离公园也很近喔，诗花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1019_201xxx", "source_sha256": "fa7e61cc3ecf052828a725db32dd22c123e5d8ad6d886de7e644a5241104b1c4", "ja": "えっ……野球ですか！？", "zh": "咦……棒球吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "1dd3ed63e1ac8e26c26d27b96c07ce50811ee7893b1b06ee9b66cd34b3945c45", "ja": "詩花さん！　私、オススメの本を持ってきました！\n冒険ものなんですけど、楽しんでもらえるはずです！", "zh": "诗花！我带推荐的书过来了！\n是冒险故事，你应该会喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "5fa248c5189501a9da191b72bef457b5e8a6e8977202d6fd025050153d922787", "ja": "はいはーい！　アタシ、オススメのブランドを\n聞きたい♪　やっぱ外国のとか？", "zh": "我有问题～！请问你推荐什么品牌的衣服呢♪\n感觉应该是国外品牌吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "8fb2c9c212c6119ef45b2c5fa92d238ac79a025293ac757849b3be48c608fd2f", "ja": "し、詩花さんは、どんなコスメを使ってるんですか？\nとっても優しい匂いで……あ、安心します……♪", "zh": "诗、诗花平常都用什么化妆品呢？\n你的味道好柔和……令、令人放心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3eaad063462031302e7525e34d1df166b897c72339854f385bb872824ecae32", "ja": "詩花さん、今、お漬物を切ってくるから、\n食べてくれるかい？　スイカのお漬物なんだよぉ。", "zh": "诗花，我要去切腌渍物，\n你要吃吗？是腌渍西瓜哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1025_201xxx", "source_sha256": "4e4f4c49fd312192bbea851f7cd90807433a5dded215d64fe2ff772410d54d6d", "ja": "え、あ、あの……ええと……！", "zh": "呃，那、那个……我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3606c6120d330d69143d515a5864f24cffb8f023db55bec5f29af7359b379049", "ja": "ほらほらみんな、ちょっと落ち着いたらどうだ。\n詩花も困ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "我说你们，先别这么着急。\n诗花都不知该如何是好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1027_201xxx", "source_sha256": "33745cc2e68eeec9ebb30d308d2da104481b9cb48fd766d54d42d4d01b347b3a", "ja": "あ……す、すみません。ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊……不、不好意思。\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "8c0f1035b8d7c090a1a4d1808071c4e0ddf3ca65146fd8e3deeef6eb8dd7f1b6", "ja": "あのさ、{$P$}。\n今、思い出したんだけど……。", "zh": "对了，{$P$}。\n我现在才想起一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1420bbf9e65ed0263d09d202e9ef0dca2d91783d8b3a6e5351b3612f52a6037", "ja": "{$P$}もアイサマの途中から、\n詩花のコト、呼び捨てにしてるよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，你从偶夏活动途中，\n就开始直呼诗花名字了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1031_026yur", "source_sha256": "1dfba202baaed6e37aec43243b6c79b7a5ba0909c514bf38c0c49d2efae5f216", "ja": "あ！　言われてみれば……確かに！", "zh": "啊！这么一说……真的耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "9416160f1d443cb9f299113c075f497b76883f77ce6188bc393a0334cbdc3fb3", "ja": "そ、そういえばあの日……{$P$}さん\nから、し、詩花さんの匂いが……！", "zh": "说、说到这个，我记得那天……\n{$P$}先生身上有诗花的味道……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b7f3d4b7694259be08259dba245ed0ffbda9b3555e5f2c95abbab3d43d9c96db", "ja": "い、いや、待て！　何か誤解されてる気がするけど、\nたまたま詩花と会って話しただけで……な、詩花？", "zh": "不、不是，先等等！你们好像有什么误会，\n我只是巧遇诗花，聊了一下罢了……对吧，诗花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1038_201xxx", "source_sha256": "f1ac6a0a60941a54c5161da37691a627971ce2c52453e10e7aea026003f91a6a", "ja": "そ、そうです。ええと……。\n色々と教えていただいただけです。個人的に！", "zh": "对、对啊。呃……\n他只是以个人立场教了我很多事情而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "a5ce866a9ec43f46398d6cbe573ed25c3ed46d6f3e8dfcbdf73e98d7eec81ab3", "ja": "個人的……？", "zh": "个人立场……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "a5ce866a9ec43f46398d6cbe573ed25c3ed46d6f3e8dfcbdf73e98d7eec81ab3", "ja": "個人的……？", "zh": "个人立场……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "a5ce866a9ec43f46398d6cbe573ed25c3ed46d6f3e8dfcbdf73e98d7eec81ab3", "ja": "個人的……？", "zh": "个人立场……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "40c9381f34615be270049f02f4834fd1d754c713865b6ed01a7d72201a12e4d8", "ja": "そっか、さっすが{$P$}！\n詩花にまで教えるなんて、すげーよな！", "zh": "原来如此啊，不愧是{$P$}！\n连诗花都能指导，好强喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "a2f2472613dde73929fe630b7a82c97e38e08d7cbef57db77de57e329b93972f", "ja": "本当にねぇ。さすがは、\nあたしらのプロデューサーだべさ！", "zh": "就是说呢～\n不愧是我们的制作人哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "81752bb4e03572b13893db1b2f9e9d351d4b2b05f863fd6f3c113284ad9c1321", "ja": "はは、ありがとう、昴、ひなた。\nふたりは本当に素直だな……。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你们，昴、日向。\n你们两个真的好率直……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "c1974459909848cc680cc703a282590d5269f1e28f06ea8c81c7a84d3f735b04", "ja": "ま、いいけどねっ。{$P$}がそんな、\nヘンなことするハズないし。", "zh": "算了，没关系啦！\n反正{$P$}又不可能做什么奇怪的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1046_045kar", "source_sha256": "41b254d3f339dd1bc1295b70502edce81eb36267206917796b3a42fd128cfbaf", "ja": "そ……、そうですよね？\n{$P$}さんに限って、そんな……。", "zh": "这……这么说也是呢？\n唯独{$P$}先生不可能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "480750b5737d218b97464e3635b7dbb8941e44a9fc9f771711f5ed716f014cd2", "ja": "ひと夏の出会い……ひと夏の……。\nはっ！　な、なんでもありません！", "zh": "夏天的短暂邂逅……夏天的短暂……\n啊！我、我什么都没说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1048_047sub", "source_sha256": "5cf8774410be983ff3ced0de0c495b34b410b18b3a3eb9cacc3d8fd9b8049146", "ja": "そうだ、早くみんなも呼んで来なきゃ。\nオレ、ちょっと行ってくる！　おーい、ロコ～！", "zh": "对了，要快点找大家过来。\n我这就去叫！喂～ROCO～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "5585216fd94bfbc93c642a28092e3ff6e74243c6aab10b8c6b36ea6c8132873e", "ja": "昴さん、あたしもいくよぉ。\nえっと、エミリーちゃんは着替え中だったかなぁ？", "zh": "昴，我也要去。\n我想想哪，艾蜜莉应该还在换衣服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "ebc9feb5658bcc3ed612ec82368efd748dd3fbdaa9b317ebcfd897acfbc8e818", "ja": "それじゃ、私は杏奈ちゃんを呼んできますね！\n今日はどこでゲームしてるんだろう……？", "zh": "那我去叫杏奈吧！\n今天她会在哪里玩游戏呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1051_045kar", "source_sha256": "c28dd33fe2cc5960d4c7a2cefb6cc1cd3aa41958747c822ecc042389f01a6feb", "ja": "し、詩花さんは、座っててくださいね。\n私、ハーブティーを入れて来ます……♪", "zh": "诗、诗花，先请坐吧。\n我去泡花草茶……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1052_020meg", "source_sha256": "b37672054fdf5b542e5c8390076bb7626bcc58f6872245fde846dc37bec2db2a", "ja": "んじゃ、アタシもちょっと行ってくるよ！\nにゃはは♪　琴葉とエレナ、どんな顔するかな～。", "zh": "那我也去叫人啰！\n呀哈哈♪不知道琴叶和艾琳娜会摆出什么表情～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1053_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d112285974c89e91433fee8c0ce6bb2a14a083c4ed08ac74d3f0576b4de98375", "ja": "……ふふっ！　やっぱり……思った通りです♪", "zh": "……呵呵！\n果然……和我想的一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1054_p", "source_sha256": "7ea2be04791f12ea9d10aee936f81d5ec89c302ffdaa54e330f7c3ff9fa51222", "ja": "うん？　何が思った通りなんだ？", "zh": "嗯？什么东西一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1055_201xxx", "source_sha256": "d3a1bf96dfdbe50c7dffa0634d8137f2a34325edf7fe5a66882239d8b647eff1", "ja": "みなさん、本当に仲良しで。\n本当に素敵で……あたたかいです。", "zh": "大家真的都很要好，\n真的好棒……好温暖喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1056_201xxx", "source_sha256": "2242acfaf28b55b5ef0511e4d3bd8fd7856f935e557a54e33fc3e989d9d25762", "ja": "こうして、劇場に通わせてもらっているうちに\nいつか私、ちゃんとなれそうな気がします。", "zh": "只要我时常像这样来剧场拜访，\n感觉总有一天就能成真了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1057_201xxx", "source_sha256": "58b899fc71e802035b59019f4442660aebebd5a2358d0baaacd66ae3cced28ed", "ja": "みなさんの、本当の……ライバルに！", "zh": "成为大家真正的……劲敌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1058_p", "source_sha256": "3e1693c35612a843d1c2af7105f88c836a92f3172d7ccc1203752a9c2b665757", "ja": "そうだな。これも個人の感想だけど……\n大丈夫。詩花ならきっと、すぐなれるよ。", "zh": "是啊。接下来也是我个人的感想……\n放心吧，诗花一定很快就能达成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1059_201xxx", "source_sha256": "803f081994582e27dfb95d8f8861e5aff682703af797133a98d755f88883bb9b", "ja": "……はいっ♪", "zh": "……嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "672e736b620d078bac5ff6644100d58273dfee6259774a1ec6b38ed0c74d7fd3", "ja": "（詩花という新たな風が、劇場に吹きこんだ。\nみんなにとっても最高の刺激になるだろう）", "zh": "（诗花这股崭新的风潮，吹进了剧场之中。\n这对大家来说会是最棒的刺激吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1061_p", "source_sha256": "be725932b6ebb7324808978c594712f9d4f17d815af52bb35752f3744d0a5052", "ja": "（詩花にとっても、大きな出会いになったはずだ。\nこれから仲間という名のライバル……いや）", "zh": "（而对诗花来说，这应该也是很重要的邂逅。\n以后她一定能认识很多有如伙伴的劲敌……不──）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_07_1062_p", "source_sha256": "c689f8ec550cd602949723ae209462aeba11e4a02504c7df436b0c445bdddb6b", "ja": "（友達が、たくさんできるだろうから）", "zh": "（是交到很多好朋友吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
